Package: varunayan
Type: Package
Title: Package for downloading and processing climatic variables from ERA5 and IMD
Version: 0.1.1.9001
Authors@R: c(person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Author: Saket Choudhary [aut,cre]
Maintainer: Saket Choudhary <saketc@iitb.ac.in>
Description: R package for downloading and processing ERA5 climate data and IMD
    (Indian Meteorological Department) gridded data for custom geographical regions.
    Provides functions to extract climate data using bounding boxes, GeoJSON polygons,
    or point coordinates and calculate heat indices. Supports various temporal frequencies and spatial resolutions
    with analysis-ready outputs.
